  lam =  10.0: (b, c) eigenvalues [4. 6.]; (u, t) eigenvalues [ 8. 12.]; negative count 0 / 0
  lam = 100.0: (b, c) eigenvalues [ 4. 96.]; (u, t) eigenvalues [  8. 192.]; negative count 0 / 0

== F. Reading R1: the documents' frozen-H reduction, H = 1 and K = K(phi)
  max |V_mu(K(phi)) + 2 mu (1 + cos 2 phi)| = 8.88e-16
  max V_lam on the circle = 0.00e+00
  range of V on the circle: [-4.0000, -0.0000]  (bounded, for every lam)

